  "description": "CreateDatabase(path, dbLangGeneral, dbVersion120). S(n LONG) with 3 rows, no index. Each step reads the first row's Bookmark of a new snapshot over S: (1) alone; (2) beside one open dynaset d1 over S; (3) beside d1 and d2; (4) beside d1, d2 and d3; then d1, d2 and d3 are closed and (5) a snapshot opens alone again; (6) beside one open table-type recordset over S; (7) beside one open snapshot; (8) a dynaset beside one open dynaset. Each probe recordset is closed after its read; the dynasets' own first Bookmarks are read when they open. Asks what moves a snapshot's base: the count of open dynasets, of open recordsets of any type, or of recordsets ever opened.",
